// Fixed-place rendering. Rows one and two are the two values that motivated
// this increment: without `fixed` they print 33.333333333333336 and
// 0.30000000000000004. Row four pins a trailing zero the value does not
// carry.
fn main() {
    println((100.0 / 3.0).fixed(2))
    println((0.1 + 0.2).fixed(2))
    println((33.333).fixed(0))
    println((1.5).fixed(3))
}
